### Shop API: try every department.
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request" above each call,
### top to bottom (later calls reuse tokens and ids from earlier ones).
### Start the app first: npm run start:dev

@base = http://localhost:3001/api

### Health check (public)
GET {{base}}/health

### ─── Security desk (Auth) ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register a new customer (public). Run once; a second time gives 409.
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "binh@shop.dev", "password": "Password123!", "name": "Binh" }

### Validation in action: bad email, short password, unknown field → 400
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email", "password": "short", "role": "ADMIN" }

### Log in as a customer
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "an@shop.dev", "password": "Password123!" }

@token = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Log in as the admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@shop.dev", "password": "Password123!" }

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ─── HR (Users) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Who am I?
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No token → 401
GET {{base}}/users/me

### Update my name
PATCH {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "An Nguyen" }

### List users: customers get 403 …
GET {{base}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### … admins get the list
GET {{base}}/users?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ─── Warehouse (Products) ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Browse products (public)
GET {{base}}/products

### One product
GET {{base}}/products/1

### Add a product (admin only)
POST {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "HS-001", "name": "Headset", "price": 59.9, "stock": 25 }

### Same sku again → 409 (PrismaExceptionFilter, error P2002)
POST {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "HS-001", "name": "Another headset", "price": 10 }

### Change a price (admin only). Stock stays as it was.
PATCH {{base}}/products/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 17.5 }

### ─── Sales (Orders) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Place an order: 2 keyboards + 1 mouse. Stock goes down, total is computed by the server.
# @name createOrder
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }, { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }], "note": "Leave at the door" }

@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.data.id}}
@trackingCode = {{createOrder.response.body.data.trackingCode}}

### Out of stock (the USB-C cable has stock 0) → 409 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK, nothing is reserved
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }, { "productId": 4, "quantity": 1 }] }

### My orders: filter, paginate and sort
GET {{base}}/orders?status=PENDING&page=1&limit=10&sort=-total
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sorting by a field that isn't allowed → 400 (ParseSortPipe)
GET {{base}}/orders?sort=email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One of my orders
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Someone else's order → 404 (the admin didn't place it)
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Track an order without logging in (public)
GET {{base}}/orders/track/{{trackingCode}}

### ─── Finance (Payments) ───────────────────────────────────────────────

### Pay for the order → the order becomes PAID
POST {{base}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "{{orderId}}" }

### Pay again → 409
POST {{base}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "{{orderId}}" }

### ─── Admin: ship it ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Customers can't change status → 403
PATCH {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "SHIPPED" }

### Admin ships the paid order
PATCH {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "SHIPPED" }

### A product that is part of an order can't be deleted → 400 (PrismaExceptionFilter, error P2003)
DELETE {{base}}/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
